SUMMARY:Season of Joy!
DESCRIPTION:Season of Joy!\nDecember 13 at 7:00 pm\nMain Stage at the Union County Performing Arts Center\nFREE Admission\nClick HERE for tickets \nCelebrate the joy of the season with a festive afternoon of holiday favorites for the whole family! Featuring the NJYS Philharmonia and the Plainfield Symphony Orchestra\, this heartwarming concert brings together musicians of all ages for an uplifting program filled with beloved seasonal classics\, joyful traditions\, and holiday cheer. \nNJYS Philharmonia Mark Gunderman\nPlainfield Symphony Orchestra Charles Prince\, Music Director & Conductor \nThis concert is part of the Wharton Arts Free Concert Series at UCPAC\, offering six free performances that celebrate music\, culture\, and community throughout the season. \n \nSupported by funding through the NJEDA‘s A.R.T. – Phase II Grant Program.
URL:https://whartonarts.org/calendar/season-of-joy/
LOCATION:Union County Performing Arts Center in Rahway\, 1601 Irving St\, Rahway\, New Jersey\, 07065\, United States
CATEGORIES:NJYS,Wharton
